01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The Business is a 2005 crime film written and directed by Nick Love.

13
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
The film stars Danny Dyer, Tamer Hassan and Roland Manookian, all of
whom were in Love's previous film The Football Factory.

14
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Geoff Bell and Georgina Chapman also appear.

15
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The plot of The Business follows the Greek tragedy-like rise and fall of a young cockney's career within a drug importing
business run by a group of British expatriate fugitive criminals living on the Costa del Sol in Spain.

16
01:25:20,000 --> 01:25:26,000
The film explores themes of drug dealer, drug smuggling,
smuggling (contraband), cocaine, coast guard.

17
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
